Sun Oct 18 17:32:38 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.13.1 (stable tags v0.12.0, 2026-10-16 and v0.13.1,
  2026-10-18, draft=false prerelease=false), covering 0.12.0 too:
  * New: restyled UI with Classic colour scheme; Recolor Artwork;
    Object Intertwine; Image Trace accuracy and large-image guard;
    Graph Type dropdown with CSV data merge; Effect Rasterize,
    Halftone and Outline Object; Blend panel; Live Paint gap
    options; Touch Type tool; PostScript open/place; .docx place;
    CCITT G3 TIFF; portable mode; print presets; variable-font
    sliders; 3D colored lights; SVG interactivity panel.
  * Import/export: PDF UserUnit pages, CMYK soft masks, Illustrator
    3 layers, rotated .ai images, hairline strokes, Hebrew/Arabic
    PDF text order, justified/Mojikumi SVG spacing.
  * Hardening (no CVE ids): image RGBA size checked before decode,
    XML ID escaping, hex and numeric input clamping, doc_inspect
    scoping, MCP cancel/progress, originals opened only on this
    computer or the document's share; Wayland pointer fix.
  * New interface languages: Brazilian Portuguese, Bulgarian,
    Swedish, Greek, Finnish, Dutch, Danish, Hindi and Indonesian.
  * Re-vendor locked (update=false retained): hayro crates move to
    0.7.2/0.3.x per the upstream lock; craft-docpath and craft-pdf
    0.1.0, stringprep and unicode-normalization added (all MIT or
    Apache-2.0); fontconfig-parser gone, skrifa 0.46.2 and
    fearless_simd 1.1.0 pruned (other versions remain).
    License re-audit over shipped targets unchanged, still no
    copyleft linked; ruzstd stays 0.9.1, so RUSTSEC-2026-0344
    remains fixed.
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list.

