Thu Oct 15 05:03:01 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.11.0 (stable tag v0.11.0, 2026-10-14,
  draft=false prerelease=false):
  * Image Trace: edges, shapes, gradients, presets, memory cut
    (16 MP photo in 0.9 GB)
  * 3D and Materials: Extrude and Bevel, Inflate, Rotate,
    Perspective; Type stylistic sets and OpenType features
  * Import/export: .ai editing data, SVG textPath and filters,
    PDF/EPS fixes, DXF and TIFF export
  * Harden importers against malicious files (no CVE assigned):
    nesting capped against stack overflow, bounded ASCII85,
    PNG/JPEG size from header, RGBA size before decoding
  * Fix RUSTSEC-2026-0344 by updating ruzstd to 0.9.1
  * Cap MCP framing input and command batches; owner-only staging
    files; refuse packaging over source documents
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list
- Vendor refresh locked (update=false retained; upstream vendor/
  still Windows-only): license re-audit over shipped targets
  unchanged, still no copyleft linked

